- SQLite integrity.
- Expected metadata.
- Schema version.
- Record counts.
- File size.
- Correct content type.

Never save an HTML error page with a `.db` extension.

If export fails, show an error instead of presenting a false successful download.

After export, provide a way to validate the downloaded file.

Do not report a backup as successfully exported until the actual file has been verified.

## B. Backup management

